            <h2 class="fw-bold mb-3">How to Use Our HTML Formatter Online</h2>

            <p>
                Clean, readable, and optimized HTML code is essential for web developers, designers, and anyone managing websites or web applications.
                Messy or unformatted HTML not only makes code hard to read and debug but can also affect website performance and SEO rankings.
                Our free online <strong>HTML Formatter</strong> and <strong>HTML Beautifier</strong> allows you to format, indent, and minify your HTML code instantly in your browser.
                No downloads, registrations, or installations are required, making it the easiest solution for developers at any skill level.
            </p>

            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4">Why Clean HTML Matters</h3>
            <p>
                Writing clean HTML has multiple advantages. Whether you are coding a personal blog, an e-commerce site, or a professional web application, clean code improves:
            </p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Readability:</strong> Well-indented HTML is easier to read, maintain, and debug.</li>
                <li><strong>Collaboration:</strong> Teams can work on the same project without confusion.</li>
                <li><strong>SEO:</strong> Search engines can parse and index structured HTML more efficiently.</li>
                <li><strong>Performance:</strong> Minified HTML reduces file size and improves page load speed.</li>
                <li><strong>Professional Standards:</strong> Clean code demonstrates good programming practices.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4">Step-by-Step Guide: How to Use the HTML Formatter</h3>
            <p>
                Formatting or minifying HTML with our tool is simple and intuitive. Follow these steps to clean or optimize your code:
            </p>
            <ol class="mb-4">
                <li><strong>Paste your HTML code</strong> – Copy your HTML code from your editor, website, or project, and paste it into the input box provided.</li>
                <li><strong>Click “Beautify”</strong> – This will format your code with proper indentation, line breaks, and spacing, making it easy to read and edit.</li>
                <li><strong>Click “Minify”</strong> – If you want to reduce file size, remove unnecessary spaces, line breaks, and comments for faster page loading.</li>
                <li><strong>Copy your result</strong> – Instantly copy the formatted or minified HTML code and paste it back into your project or editor.</li>
                <li><strong>Preview changes</strong> – Optionally, you can preview your code in a browser to verify that formatting or minification has not affected the page display.</li>
            </ol>

            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4">Benefits of Using Our HTML Formatter / Beautifier</h3>
            <p>
                Using a professional HTML formatting tool has significant advantages for both beginners and advanced developers:
            </p>
            <ul>
                <li>✔ <strong>Instant Formatting:</strong> No waiting or complicated setup. Beautify your HTML with a single click.</li>
                <li>✔ <strong>Minify for Speed:</strong> Reduce your HTML file size, improving website load time and overall performance.</li>
