            <p><strong>Q4: Will minifying HTML break my website?</strong></p>
            <p>No. Minification only removes unnecessary spaces, line breaks, and comments without changing the functionality or structure of your HTML code. However, always test your site after minification to ensure scripts and inline styles work correctly.</p>

            <p><strong>Q5: Which browsers are supported?</strong></p>
